}}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT -1 273 "\nRecommended component values for 5V \+
from Table 8-2:\n\nR1 = 220.0k, R2 = 30.0k (nominally exactly 5V)\nL1 \+
= 1.5uH (min), 1.8uH (typical), 4.7uH (max)   [nominal values]\nCout =
 22uF (min) 44uF (typical) 100uF (max)    [nominal values, not effecti
ve capacitance]\nCFF = 10\226470pF" }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT -1 0 "" }}
{EXCHG {PARA 0 "> " 0 "" {MPLTEXT 1 0 1061 "V[OUT(TARGET)] := 5.05;\n
\n# Maximum output current for 5.05V is ~1.7A:\n#   250ma baseline\n# \+
  900ma USB 1.1\n#   200ma for PMOD\n#   350ma buffer\n# But we set th
e TPS54624x max of 4A to be safe.\nI_OUT := 4;\n\n# For 5V, we prefer \+
parallel resistors of similar values to statistically\n# minimize erro
r due to the 1% tolerance.\nR1[TYP] := evalf(R_Parallel(120*k, 220*k))
;\nR2[TYP] := evalf(R_Parallel(20*k, 22*k));\n\nR[TOL] := 0.01;\nR1[MI
N] := evalf(R_Parallel(120*k * (1 - R[TOL]), 220*k * (1 - R[TOL])));\n
R1[MAX] := evalf(R_Parallel(120*k * (1 + R[TOL]), 220*k * (1 + R[TOL])
));\nR2[MIN] := evalf(R_Parallel(20*k * (1 - R[TOL]), 22*k * (1 - R[TO
L])));\nR2[MAX] := evalf(R_Parallel(20*k * (1 + R[TOL]), 22*k * (1 + R
[TOL])));\n\n# Derate capacitors for 5.05V\nC_4u7 := 4.7 * (1 - 0.6644
926) * u; # https://product.samsungsem.com/mlcc/CL05A475MP5NRN.do\nC_1
0u :=  10 * (1 - 0.5385295) * u; # https://product.samsungsem.com/mlcc
/CL10A106MA8NRN.do\nC_22u :=  22 * (1 - 0.5230603) * u; # https://prod
uct.samsungsem.com/mlcc/CL21A226MAQNNN.do\n\nC[OUT(TYP)] := C_22u + C_
22u + C_4u7;" }}{PARA 11 "" 1 "" {XPPMATH 20 "6#>&%\"VG6#-%$OUTG6#%'TA
