{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT -1 188 "\nRecommended component values for 7V fr
om Table 8-2:\n\nR1 = 320.0k, R2 = 30.0k\nL1 = 1.8uH (min), 2.2uH (typ
ical),  4.7uH (max)\nCout = 22uF (min), 44uF (typical), 100uF (max)\nC
